        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Grim, Ares, Infernus\n- Bands: Arvas, Borknagar, Gorgoroth\n- Roles: drummer, bassist, guitarist\n\nFacts:\n- In 1992, Infernus formed Gorgoroth as guitarist.\n- Infernus is the only original member still remaining in Gorgoroth.\n- Gorgoroth has released nine studio albums.\n- In summer 1996, Grim, who was Borknagar's drummer, joined Arvas.\n- In summer 1996, Ares, who was Gorgoroth's bassist, joined Arvas.",
